+# InteriorGS → FieryGS native renderer adapter
+
+This adapter loads the unmodified InteriorGS explicit PLY into FieryGS's existing
+`GaussianModel`, constructs a minimal synthetic camera, and calls the native CUDA
+Gaussian and fire renderers. It does not retrain PGSR or reimplement ray marching.
+
+## Verified environment
+
+- Python 3.9.23
+- PyTorch 2.5.1 + CUDA 11.8
+- NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU
+- `torch.cuda.is_available() == True`
+
+## Verified source asset
+
+- PLY: `D:/interiorgs_data/office_01/3dgs_explicit.ply`
+- Gaussian count: 927,067
+- SH degree: 3
+- Required fields: xyz (3), opacity (1), scale (3), rotation (4), DC SH (3), remaining SH (45)
+- Compatibility diagnostics: `D:/interiorgs_data/office_01/fierygs/ply_diagnostics.json`
+
+The PLY is read directly and is not copied or modified.
+
+## Commands
+
+```powershell
+cd C:\Users\Administrator\Documents\quadruped_robot_research\FieryGS
+
+D:\anaconda\envs\fire_gaussian_win\python.exe tools\check_ply.py `
+  D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\3dgs_explicit.ply `
+  --json D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\fierygs\ply_diagnostics.json
+
+D:\anaconda\envs\fire_gaussian_win\python.exe -m tests.render_interiorgs `
+  --ply D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\3dgs_explicit.ply `
+  --camera D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\fierygs\camera.json `
+  --output D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\fierygs\test_render.png
+
+D:\anaconda\envs\fire_gaussian_win\python.exe -m tests.validate_interiorgs_voxels `
+  --ply D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\3dgs_explicit.ply `
+  --roi D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\fire_roi.json `
+  --voxel-dir D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\fierygs
+
+D:\anaconda\envs\fire_gaussian_win\python.exe -m simulation.fire_main `
+  --config_file arguments/office_01_native_200f.yaml
+
+D:\anaconda\envs\fire_gaussian_win\python.exe -m tests.render_interiorgs_fire `
+  --ply D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\3dgs_explicit.ply `
+  --camera D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\fierygs\fire_camera.json `
+  --voxel-dir D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\fierygs `
+  --simulation-dir output\office_01_native_200f\sim_output `
+  --frame 199 --coarse-samples 128 --fine-samples 1024 `
+  --output D:\interiorgs_data\office_01\fierygs\fire_render_frame_199_native.png
+```
+
+## Scope and limitations
+
+- The current burnable mask is retained only as a coupling test. It is not a final material solution.
+- The camera is synthetic because the downloaded InteriorGS scene has no COLMAP cameras.
+- No PGSR retraining, SAM/VLM material reasoning, browser renderer, or custom ray marcher is used.
+- The adapter leaves `scene/gaussian_model.py`, `gaussian_renderer/__init__.py`, and
+  `gaussian_renderer/renderer_with_fire.py` unchanged.
